    id: "CP-022", title: "Ocean Spray rewarded and joined a creator-led cultural moment", organization: "Ocean Spray", sector: "Agricultural cooperative and consumer beverages", geography: "United States, with global social reach", approximateScale: "Established grower-owned cooperative and national consumer brand", businessModel: "Grower cooperative producing and selling cranberry products", period: "2020",
